.Dd November 24, 2026
.Dt MB 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mb
.Nd store, search, and cite versioned metaBrain documents
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl Fl store Ar store
.Op Fl Fl server Ar endpoint | Fl Fl no-server
.Ar command
.Op Ar arguments ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
operates on a local metaBrain store directly or through the
.Nm mbd
daemon.
Read the selected store's own agent manual with
.Cm mb get /AGENTS.md .
It describes efficient retrieval, citations, and local instructions.
A newly initialized store includes this document by default.
Run
.Cm mb ensure-guide
to install the bundled guide in an existing store when it is missing.
An existing guide retains its contents and version.
.Pp
Run
.Cm mb man
for the command list or
.Cm mb man search
for a command's current flags.
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width "METABRAIN_STORE"
.It Ev METABRAIN_STORE
Store location when no explicit
.Fl Fl store
is supplied.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width ".metabrain/store.leveldb"
.It Pa /AGENTS.md
Virtual document inside the selected store.
Read it with
.Cm mb get /AGENTS.md .
.It Pa .metabrain/store.leveldb
Default store discovered in the working directory or its ancestors.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
mb search --tag storage --view refs --limit 5
mb search "nightly backups" --view evidence --max-tokens 512
mb get --ref "$ref" --context section --max-tokens 1024
mb links /policies/Retention.md --incoming --block keep-last
.Ed
